ame": "2025_08_14T10_57_37_000Z.png", "id": "1488938728978297", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822817_1488938732311630_1761406613498481697_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r__uzstVr6UQ7kNvwFY4UOx&_nc_oc=AdrY8qTWAmmGuPXh4oXO4AhhkJXKpR1Bjm5IQeHXSfPkIJxT86ECeGDKVIU9xOXIyP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6hUZTHDiFd_LEkNcCAmkVzqB77PHJrMOsOVI_YjS5JaA&oe=6A0321BE"}, {"file_name": "2025_08_14T11_00_35_000Z.png", "id": "617881834714241", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822897_617881838047574_1344351920777635266_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jnSOZB-LwzMQ7kNvwEgX_S6&_nc_oc=AdrxN7gRLdsiEWEoxFPOJgQLpc-ESCgQqsexjtMpLcDlTHhty_Cul4bMx57YfcQxkRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4pbQmv4sKhHY3S14TvXx6nzv0q2paZSRDdkdKk-sXNbg&oe=6A0334A9"}, {"file_name": "2025_08_14T11_14_49_000Z.png", "id": "1228567169021536", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822034_1228567172354869_9107760783255308761_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nbZdqYmzrSUQ7kNvwHtyylV&_nc_oc=AdoiVxd2HVMOkKg_WlFXj5aV2L9FKGYZgU9TPvS86SbVHY-cxYKyeBCrcuqmkl3KJ4A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7VTId3szWkcBMj9a8VUVB_dnRGLBG9fMMcUEbGVCtDLQ&oe=6A032D3A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "mockup_store_capsule_main_nofont.png", "id": "2310533302678158", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310731_2310533306011491_3620319197284353638_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i2GotzitGDsQ7kNvwFMORIN&_nc_oc=AdrpDLRA8UiFG0bmTJlCzG5S80Ae_sFcbzDdc1oFTxTFbBDHWaZnfSr6YtL0SbwiUIE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4DXx1EiaTBf61b-vM1kypt5C9w5cd6LnuVOdKNP27DeA&oe=6A031957"}, "display_name": "Carbon Dreams Land", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Carbon Dream$ Land isn\u2019t your average VR game \u2013 it\u2019s a wild, satirical rollercoaster through the absurdities of the fossil-fuel era. Step into an over-the-top theme park where oil, coal, and gas are celebrated like it\u2019s 1950. But there\u2019s a catch: the show is run by Donnie Dino \u2013 a fire-breathing, gold-tie-wearing tyrannosaurus with an ego as big as his CO\u2082 footprint.\n\nTogether with up to three friends, you\u2019ll dive into short, punchy missions (10\u201315 minutes) that mix fast-paced action with sharp climate satire. Your mission: blow up oil rigs, dodge diesel-powered drones, expose fossil-fuel propaganda, and turn scrap into shiny wind turbines. Armed with futuristic tools, quick reflexes, and the guidance of a rebellious scientist, you\u2019ll fight through arenas packed with traps, explosions, and ridiculous characters.\n\nFeatures:\n- Cooperative VR action for 1\u20134 players on Meta Quest & Steam VR\n\n- Short, replayable missions \u2013 perfect for quick sessions\n\n- Unique gameplay mix of destruction and rebuilding\n\n- A spectacular boss fight against Donnie Dino, the fossil-fuel showman\n\n- A colorful, exaggerated world that\u2019s as funny as it is fiery\n\nThe world\u2019s on fire \u2013 so grab your friends, strap on your headset, and make fossil fuels NOT great again.", "short_description": "Welcome to Carbon Dream$ Land \u2013 the theme park where fossil fuels are made \u201cgreat again\u201d! Team up with up to 3 friends in this fast-paced, satirical VR action game. Blast oil towers, turn scrap into wind turbines, and dodge diesel drones in intense 10\u201315 minute missions. Face off against Donnie Dino \u2013 a gold-tied, fire-breathing tyrant with an ego the size of his CO\u2082 footprint. Save the planet, one explosive mission at a time!"}]}, "developer_name": "Pixelcloud GmbH & Co. KG", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pixelcloud.de/data-protection-carbon-dreams-land.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pixelcloud GmbH & Co. 